PolySync Installation\par\par
This installer installs PolySync for the current Windows user.\par
Application files are installed in Local AppData / Programs / PolySync.\par
Your existing device identity, paired devices and synchronization settings are preserved. Uninstalling removes application files and shortcuts; it does not remove your synchronized files or user data.\par\par
Close PolySync from the system tray before manually upgrading or uninstalling. In-app updates wait until synchronization and transfers are idle.\par\par
Project: https://github.com/Leoforever123/Polysync\par
